p>然后就可以愉快地使用了。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/0y5Q287F.png\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1786748168, "replies": 33, "id": 1234521}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/abea/47ba/1162_large.png?m=1768038538", "name": "gemini", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/abea/47ba/1162_normal.png?m=1768038538", "title": "Google Gemini", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/gemini", "topics": 139, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Google Gemini", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/abea/47ba/1162_mini.png?m=1768038538", "stars": 67, "founder_id": 308348, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1162, "parent_node_name": null}, "member": {"id": 663592, "username": "APEC", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/APEC", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_mini.png?m=1732094903", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_normal.png?m=1732094903", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_large.png?m=1732094903", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_xlarge.png?m=1732094903", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_xxlarge.png?m=1732094903", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b4d9/9d49/663592_xxxlarge.png?m=1732094903", "created": 1700543706, "last_modified": 1732094903, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Mandelo", "last_touched": 1786725017, "title": "大冤种！刚全额续费 Gemini Pro，给我账号封了！", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234459", "created": 1786703817, "deleted": 0, "content": "对 Gemini 感情很深，留下了非常多的交互。\r\n\r\n上个月底刚刚在官网续费了一年，今天发现突然就提示“Gemini 目前不支持你所在的地区。敬请期待！”，账号有种凉凉了的感觉。试了很多遍，发现不是代理的问题，只要一登录就有这个提示了，不登录还能免费用用，真是大冤种啊！\r\n\r\n都知道 Gemini 目前这个阶段是 tough period ，所以特意续费支持。\r\n\r\n真是有种“我本将心向明月，奈何明月照沟渠”的苍凉感。\r\n\r\n现在首要的目标：\r\n1. 希望尽可能恢复 Gemini 的使用；\r\n2. 如果确实不行，希望至少能退款吧...\r\n\r\n大家有谁也遇到类似的情况了么？能否分享一点相关经验？谢谢！", "content_rendered": "对 Gemini 感情很深，留下了非常多的交互。<br /><br />上个月底刚刚在官网续费了一年，今天发现突然就提示“Gemini 目前不支持你所在的地区。敬请期待！”，账号有种凉凉了的感觉。试了很多遍，发现不是代理的问题，只要一登录就有这个提示了，不登录还能免费用用，真是大冤种啊！<br /><br />都知道 Gemini 目前这个阶段是 tough period ，所以特意续费支持。<br /><br />真是有种“我本将心向明月，奈何明月照沟渠”的苍凉感。<br /><br />现在首要的目标：<br />1. 希望尽可能恢复 Gemini 的使用；<br />2. 如果确实不行，希望至少能退款吧...<br /><br />大家有谁也遇到类似的情况了么？能否分享一点相关经验？谢谢！", "last_modified": 1786714893, "replies": 28, "id": 1234459}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f7e6/c855/173_large.png?m=1422181051", "name": "accessory", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f7e6/c855/173_normal.png?m=1422181051", "title": "配件", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/accessory", "topics": 784, "footer": "", "header": "关于各类新酷配件的购买和使用的讨论。", "title_alternative": "Accessory", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/f7e6/c855/173_mini.png?m=1422181051", "stars": 400, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 173, "parent_node_name": "apple"}, "member": {"id": 562494, "username": "unt", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/unt", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/37c0/562494_mini.png?m=1786719514", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/37c0/562494_normal.png?m=1786719514", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/37c0/562494_large.png?m=1786719514", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/37c0/562494_xlarge.png?m=1786719514", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/37c0/562494_xxlarge.png?m=1786719514", "created": 1637489859, "last_modified": 1786719514, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "youngster", "last_touched": 1786774426, "title": "刚买了个贝尔金充电器，准备做 Mac 充电器的平替，然后测了下纹波，结果震惊了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234506", "created": 1786719947, "deleted": 0, "content": "https://i.imgur.com/oNI3n8h.jpeg\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/YDfXl6H.jpeg\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/HohUFbl.jpeg\r\n\r\n以上是测试数据，居然是原装充电器纹波最大，然后贝尔金的纹波也不咋地，没想到联想的口红电源频谱最干净（家里有好多，因为啸叫+代工厂的原因，平时还看不上它）\r\n\r\n请各位电子大佬帮忙分析下，看下哪个充电器最好，然后还需要测哪些参数（专业仪器就别说了，没意义）", "content_rendered": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/oNI3n8h.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oNI3n8h.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/YDfXl6H.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YDfXl6H.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/HohUFbl.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HohUFbl.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br />以上是测试数据，居然是原装充电器纹波最大，然后贝尔金的纹波也不咋地，没想到联想的口红电源频谱最干净（家里有好多，因为啸叫+代工厂的原因，平时还看不上它）<br /><br />请各位电子大佬帮忙分析下，看下哪个充电器最好，然后还需要测哪些参数（专业仪器就别说了，没意义）", "last_modified": 1786752505, "replies": 28, "id": 1234506}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72705, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9755, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 355863, "username": "ainyyy", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/ainyyy", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b22c4dfe580d8c9bc4dfae25e9d06bf5?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex